WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:05.403
"Uh-oh!" Cupcake said.

2
00:00:05.404 --> 00:00:07.729
Berry was rolling.

3
00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:13.070
He was close to the edge!

4
00:00:13.071 --> 00:00:17.726
Cupcake ran fast.

5
00:00:17.727 --> 00:00:21.302
"I'll catch you!"

6
00:00:21.303 --> 00:00:24.509
Cupcake caught Berry.

7
00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:36.590
"Whew!" she said.

8
00:00:36.591 --> 00:00:43.462
"You saved me!" Berry said.

9
00:00:43.463 --> 00:00:48.024
He smiled. "Thank you!"

10
00:00:48.025 --> 00:00:51.163
Cupcake smiled too.

11
00:00:51.164 --> 00:00:54.692
"Do you like to dance?"

12
00:00:54.693 --> 00:01:01.237
"I love to dance!" Berry said.

13
00:01:01.238 --> 00:01:12.383
"I like to sing," Cupcake said.

14
00:01:12.384 --> 00:01:21.867
Berry grinned. "Me too!

15
00:01:21.868 --> 00:01:32.187
And sometimes I like to roll!"

16
00:01:32.188 --> 00:01:43.997
"I like to roll too!" Cupcake said.

17
00:01:43.998 --> 00:01:49.331
"And jump up and down!"

18
00:01:49.332 --> 00:01:59.190
Berry jumped up and down. "Me too!"

19
00:01:59.191 --> 00:02:05.635
"Wow! This is great!" Cupcake said.

20
00:02:05.636 --> 00:02:10.702
She jumped up and down.

21
00:02:10.703 --> 00:02:15.519
"We like all the same things!"

22
00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:18.523
"Yeah!" Berry said.

23
00:02:18.524 --> 00:02:39.776
"We can be friends!"

24
00:02:39.777 --> 00:02:44.179
Cupcake did a big jump.

25
00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:46.482
"Woo-hoo!"

26
00:02:46.483 --> 00:02:52.896
Icing flew all over.

27
00:02:52.897 --> 00:02:55.865
"Hey!" a voice said.

28
00:02:55.866 --> 00:03:01.906
"Who threw that?"

